name: sim.setObjectAlias
description: Sets the alias of an object
luaSynopsis: sim.setObjectAlias(int objectHandle, string objectAlias)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setObjectAlias(int objectHandle, string objectAlias)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
2. objectAlias: alias of the object. Allowed characters include 0-9, a-z, A-Z, and underscores. Illegal characters are replaced with underscores
outputs:
